{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂1の乃木坂ヲタク\nかりんの発音 上り坂↑\n伊藤かりん↑です(っｴ`o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/16/0589440/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪ばっさり切ってみたよ～♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生の頃ずっとこの長さだったから\nすごい落ち着く(๑⁰ -⁰)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のブログは\n私の冬のお出かけの話題を2つ\n書きまーす(   ´ω`   )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の夜急遽琴子を誘って\n今日ディズニーランド行ってきました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/16/0589440/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ねランドがアナ雪なの！\n私の大好きなオラフくんがいたの！\nトロールちゃんもスヴェンもいたのに\nクリストフが居なかった(´•̥ ̯ •̥`)\nクリストーフ(´•̥ ̯ •̥`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい(笑)というわけで(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パレードもワンスも観れて\n幸せだったよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/16/0589440/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/16/0589440/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴子にワンスの感想を聞いたら\n「すごかったね！(棒)」でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/16/0589440/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな琴子