reak"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"---------"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明後日、日曜日の握手会で\n私のレーンでNHKさんが\n撮影に来てくださるみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな映っちゃうかもだけど\nご了承ください(´,,•ω•,,｀)  ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもいつも通り楽しい握手会に\nしましょーね(๑•̀‧̫•́๑)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/karin.itou/img/blog/karin.itou/img/2015/01/16/0589440/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"か  り  ん  (っｴ`o)"}],"source":"archive"}